#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2601
msgid ""
"On the test tab of the dialog (see <xref linkend=\"normality-example-3\"/>) "
"select the Lilliefors (Kolmogorov-Smirnov) Test."
msgstr ""
"Välj testet av Lilliefors (Kolmogorov–Smirnov) på fliken Test i dialogrutan "
"(se <xref linkend=\"normality-example-3\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2604 C/gnumeric.xml:2756 C/gnumeric.xml:2841
msgid "Specify an appropriate significance level Alpha, say 0.05."
msgstr "Ange en lämplig signifikansnivå för alfa, till exempel 0,05."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2606
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Create Normal Probability "
"Plot</guibutton></quote> option to include a normal probability plot in the "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Välj alternativet <quote><guibutton>Skapa "
"normalsannolikhetsdiagram</guibutton></quote> om du vill ta med ett "
"normalsannolikhetsdiagram i resultatet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2614
msgid ""
"The output of this normality test is shown in <xref linkend=\"normality-"
"example-4\"/>. Note that the graph appears initially on top of the output "
"data and needs to be moved to make the data visible."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet från normalitetstestet visas i <xref linkend=\"normality-"
"example-4\"/>. Diagrammet visas först ovanpå resultatdata och behöver "
"flyttas för att data ska synas."

