#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2668
msgid "One Median"
msgstr "Test med en median"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2670
msgid ""
"The One Median test tool provides two non-parametric tests that test the "
"null hypothesis that the sample comes from a population with a given median:"
msgstr ""
"Verktyget Test med en median innehåller två icke-parametriska test av "
"nollhypotesen att urvalet kommer från en population med en viss median:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2677
msgid ""
"Selecting the appropriate submenu item opens the dialog with the respective "
"test preselected."
msgstr ""
"Välj rätt alternativ i undermenyn för att öppna dialogrutan med det "
"motsvarande testet förvalt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2683
msgid ""
"This section describes the one sample sign test to test the null hypothesis "
"that the sample comes from a population with the given median. The tool to "
"perform a sign test to test the null hypothesis that two paired samples come"
" from populations with the same median is in section <xref linkend=\"two-"
"median-sign-test-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet beskrivs teckentestet för ett urval, som prövar "
"nollhypotesen att urvalet kommer från en population med den angivna "
"medianen. Verktyget för teckentest av nollhypotesen att två parade urval "
"kommer från populationer med samma median beskrivs i avsnittet <xref "
"linkend=\"two-median-sign-test-tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2693
msgid "One-Median Test Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för test med en median"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2695
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-signtest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the one-"
"median test dialog used by the Sign Test and the Wilcoxon Signed Rank "
"Test.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-signtest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för test med en median, som används av teckentestet och Wilcoxons "
"teckenrangtest.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2707
msgid ""
"The Sign Test tool performs a one-sample sign test whether the sample comes "
"from a population with a given median."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget Teckentest utför ett teckentest för ett urval och prövar om "
"urvalet kommer från en population med en viss median."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2709 C/gnumeric.xml:2802
msgid ""
"The sample data range is specified via the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry (see <xref linkend=\"one-median-tool-"
"dialog\"/>). The given range or list of ranges can be grouped into separate "
"data sets by columns, rows, or areas. The tool performs a separate test for "
"each data set."
msgstr ""
"Ange urvalets dataområde i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote> (se <xref linkend=\"one-"
"median-tool-dialog\"/>). Området eller listan med områden kan delas in i "
"separata datamängder efter kolumner, rader eller områden. Verktyget utför "
"ett separat test för varje datamängd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2715 C/gnumeric.xml:2808
msgid ""
"On the <quote><guilabel>Test</guilabel></quote>tab of the dialog (see <xref "
"linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog-test-tab\"/>) the predicted median as well "
"as the significance level are specified."
msgstr ""
"Ange den förutsedda medianen och signifikansnivån på fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Test</guilabel></quote> i dialogrutan (se <xref "
"linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog-test-tab\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2719
msgid "The Test Tab of the One-Median Test Dialog"
msgstr "Testfliken i dialogrutan för test med en median"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2721
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-signtest-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the test "
"tab of the one-median test dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-signtest-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av testfliken i"
" dialogrutan för test med en median.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2735
msgid "Using the Sign Test Tool"
msgstr "Använda teckentestverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2737
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to perform a Sign Test on the data given in <xref "
"linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog\"/> to determine whether the sample comes "
"from a population of mean 3."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill utföra ett teckentest på data i <xref linkend=\"one-median-"
"tool-dialog\"/> för att avgöra om urvalet kommer från en population med "
"medianen 3."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2743 C/gnumeric.xml:2828
msgid ""
"Enter A1:A19 (or Sheet1!$A$1:$A$19) in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry by typing this directly into the entry or "
"clicking in the entry field and then selecting the range on the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Ange A1:A19 (eller Sheet1!$A$1:$A$19) i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote> genom att skriva det "
"direkt eller klicka i fältet och sedan markera området på bladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2749 C/gnumeric.xml:2834
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains a label. (see <xref linkend=\"one-median-tool-"
"dialog\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Välj alternativet <quote><guibutton>Etiketter</guibutton></quote> eftersom "
"den första raden innehåller en etikett (se <xref linkend=\"one-median-tool-"
"dialog\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2752
msgid ""
"On the <quote><guibutton>Test</guibutton></quote> tab of the dialog (see "
"<xref linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog-test-tab\"/>) select the Sign Test."
msgstr ""
"Välj Teckentest på fliken <quote><guibutton>Test</guibutton></quote> i "
"dialogrutan (se <xref linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog-test-tab\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2758 C/gnumeric.xml:2843
msgid ""
"Select thepecify the median of the null hypothesis (3) in the "
"<quote><guibutton>Predicted Median</guibutton></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange nollhypotesens median (3) i fältet <quote><guibutton>Förutsedd "
"median</guibutton></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2765
msgid ""
"The output of this sign test is shown in <xref linkend=\"sign-test-dialog-"
"output\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet från teckentestet visas i <xref linkend=\"sign-test-dialog-"
"output\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2770
msgid "Output of a Sign Test"
msgstr "Resultat från ett teckentest"

